%S A402417 0,2,7,23,83,311,1081,2641,8089,18001,67369,132001,360721,605641
%N A402417 a(n) = A402416(A102476(n)) is largest minimal element of cosets of (Z/NZ)*^2 in (Z/NZ)*, where N = A102476(n), (Z/NZ)* is the multiplicative group of integers modulo N and (Z/NZ)*^2 is the subgroup of squares.
%C A402417 N = A102476(n) is the least N such that (Z/NZ)*^2 has index 2^n is (Z/NZ)*.
%C A402417 a(n) is the largest element of the n-th row in A402419.
%o A402417 (PARI) a(n) = if(n<=1, [0, 2][n+1], vecmax(A402418_row( 4*factorback(primes(n-1)) ))) \\ see A402418 for its program
%Y A402417 Cf. A102476, A402416, A402418, A402419.
